      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你以1.5m左右的间隔在跑道上做记号，\r\n然后跑的时候精准地踩到那上面，尽量不要减速。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7f15cae777b6e66a6231bae3e33d78364642b7e9ff2ab7edea6b5a0dfcfa09b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
